# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever wrote it.
# This replaces a list of nine extensions, which left backend/Dockerfile,
# the mail templates and both .env.example files uncovered: a CRLF written
# into any of those by a Windows editor is a container that fails on a RUN
# line for a carriage return nobody can see in the diff.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
